{"seq":24,"trial_id":"harness-zero-select-2026-11/zero-min-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r4","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T22:02:08.099Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"c2ce420f3f55b40ec1bd402b1ec8a793d3c43ff12342abb5ec5393df1542354b","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"Hi Pree, here's what I found on Marrow Fieldworks. I only looked at places you can see too: Moss's team digests, #central-random, #central-team, #inc-tansley-carrier-api and our DM.\n\n*Named as Marrow Fieldworks*\n• *PD-5302*: #central-random, Hollis on Wed 14 Oct. He called it \"one more ticket number for Marrow Fieldworks… for a follow-up from this week.\" This is the only ticket I found that's tied to Marrow Fieldworks by name.\n\n*Probably Marrow Fieldworks, but not named*\n• *#4409* and *#4412*: Moss's \"Central handoffs next week\" digest (2 Jan 2026, teams/team-central/digests). It says Marrow Fieldworks changed hands on Mon 5 Jan. It also says Hollis flagged these two open tickets on \"Pree's dealer account\" before that handoff. #4409 is a recurring timeout on the Gatehouse Check-In report at Salina North (Bay 4 and the west grain-bin apron, 06:00 flatbed intake). #4412 is a driver SMS prompt glitch when staging combine trailers on unpaved overflow lots. The digest never says \"dealer account\" means Marrow Fieldworks, so please check.\n• *#8841*: #central-random, Tobias on Tue 13 Oct. He flagged it for West yard Door 2 double-booking when flatbeds check in early at the kiosk, in the Plains depots on \"Tobias's dealer account.\" If Marrow Fieldworks went to Tobias in January, this could be the same account, but nothing I can see confirms that.\n\n*Not Marrow Fieldworks (Marrow Agrisupply is a separate account)*\n• FR-882, a feature request in the same Moss digest\n• PD-4821, in #central-team on 9 Jun 2026\n\nNothing else turned up. Moss's other digests cover North accounts, and there's no Marrow Fieldworks folder in the shared files."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
{"seq":25,"trial_id":"harness-zero-select-2026-11/zero-min-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sy-03-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r4","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T22:02:15.206Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"d4e5090ca65e81b326d70946ac02bdb1121b3e752a6836fbea6a41c664dc2cb9","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"I found one ticket that's tied to Marrow Fieldworks by name, plus three more that probably belong to it but aren't named. I sent you the full list in our DM. I only looked where you can look yourself: Moss's team digests, #central-random, #central-team, #inc-tansley-carrier-api and our DM.\n\n**Named as Marrow Fieldworks**\n- **PD-5302:** Hollis posted it in #central-random on Wed 14 Oct, as a follow-up from this week.\n\n**Probably Marrow Fieldworks, but not named**\n- **#4409 and #4412:** These are in Moss's \"Central handoffs next week\" digest from 2 Jan 2026. It says Marrow Fieldworks changed hands on Mon 5 Jan, and that Hollis flagged these two open tickets on \"Pree's dealer account\" before the handoff. The digest never says that account is Marrow Fieldworks.\n  - #4409 is a Gatehouse Check-In report that keeps timing out at Salina North.\n  - #4412 is a glitch with the driver text-message prompts.\n- **#8841:** Tobias posted it in #central-random on Tue 13 Oct, about West yard Door 2 double-booking on \"Tobias's dealer account.\" If Marrow Fieldworks went to Tobias in January, this could be the same account, but nothing I can see confirms that.\n\n**Not Marrow Fieldworks**\n- **FR-882** (in the same Moss digest) and **PD-4821** (in #central-team on 9 Jun 2026) both belong to Marrow Agrisupply, which is a separate account.\n\nMoss's other digests only cover North accounts, and there's no Marrow Fieldworks folder in the shared files."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1792159200.000128"}}
